{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-3d-printed-dragon-fidget-toy-sold-via-ebay-2603-0143","content_id":"adbe4d40-c19f-4cf0-b16d-6c9c26063f35","description":"Product Recall for 3D Printed Dragon Fidget Toy sold via eBay presenting a serious risk of choking.\r\n","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"ee03592f-165c-48f9-8dc2-5e9f4971438e","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-15T09:25:54+01:00","id":"ee03592f-165c-48f9-8dc2-5e9f4971438e","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-05-15T09:25:54+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a06d89222977ebc82cb3ff7/2603-0143-product-recall-3d-printed-dragon-fidget-toy.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: 3D Printed Dragon Fidget Toy</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of choking as small parts can easily detach or break off during reasonably foreseeable use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users, and known customers are being contacted.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (eBay)</p>\n\n<p>We recommend owners stop using this product immediately. Contact the distributor you purchased from to request redress.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Table Games (Non-Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturer</td>\n      <td>Wuhan Ballihong Electronic Commerce Co. Ltd</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>Y1522-BlackGold</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>eBay Listing Name</td>\n      <td>3D Printed Magic Dragon Moveable Joint Fidget Toy Rotatable Articulated Office Desktop Ornament Adults Kid Toy Crafts Gift</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>3D-printed, multicoloured dragon fidget toy. Product is marketed as a desk ornament or fidget toy.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_ee03592f-165c-48f9-8dc2-5e9f4971438e\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a06d89222977ebc82cb3ff7/2603-0143-product-recall-3d-printed-dragon-fidget-toy.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of choking as small parts can easily detach or break off during reasonably foreseeable use. These parts fit entirely within a small parts cylinder and pose a choking risk to young children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users, and known customers are being contacted.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (eBay)</p>\n\n<p>We recommend owners stop using this product immediately. Contact the distributor you purchased from to request redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2603-0143</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-15T09:08:09Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-15","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-15T10:08:09+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-3d-printed-dragon-fidget-toy-sold-via-ebay-2603-0143","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-3d-printed-dragon-fidget-toy-sold-via-ebay-2603-0143","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-3d-printed-dragon-fidget-toy-sold-via-ebay-2603-0143","content_id":"adbe4d40-c19f-4cf0-b16d-6c9c26063f35","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-15T09:08:09Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: 3D Printed Dragon Fidget Toy sold via eBay (2603-0143)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-3d-printed-dragon-fidget-toy-sold-via-ebay-2603-0143","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","